### 在 IDEA 选择 local 环境；凭据从已忽略的私密环境文件取得。
### SF10001 是自动化测试数据；本地没有此订单时应返回404，不会自动插入数据。
### shopId模拟店铺页面携带的上下文，客户不用在消息中输入商铺ID。
@shopId = 100

### 先取得 CSRF token；保持 HTTP 客户端保存的 session cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/security/csrf
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

> {%
    client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
%}

### 普通消息：识别为非查单后仍回显；DeepSeek开关关闭时直接回显
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你好"
}

### 查当前买家在商铺100的订单：存在则200，不存在或属于别人则404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "查订单 SF10001"
}

### 自然语言查单：先在.local/deepseek-secrets.yml填Key并启用，重启local应用
### 订单属于本人则200；不存在或属于别人则404；模型故障则503
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我看看SF10001订单发货了吗？"
}

### 自然语言缺订单号：返回ORDER_SELECTION和当前店铺本人订单卡片
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "帮我查一下订单发货情况"
}

### 查看当前店铺本人订单：最多20笔，响应含type、orders和nextAfterId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我的订单"
}

### 继续查看：把示例2020换成上一条回复给出的游标；它不是页码，不能按页码加一
### 只有回复中出现“还有更多订单，请发送”时，才需要复制那条完整指令继续
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我的订单 2020"
}

### 列表指令非法游标：400，并提示正确格式
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "我的订单 -1"
}

### 单独发送查订单：展示当前店铺本人订单供选择，不调用模型
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "查订单"
}

### 空消息：400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": ""
}

### JSON 格式错误：预期 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": }

### 点击订单卡片：仍按当前店铺和认证买家查单，不调用模型
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "咨询此订单",
  "orderNo": "SF10001"
}

### 选中订单后的自然语言：每个请求携带orderNo，不依赖跨消息记忆
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shops/{{shopId}}/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "发货了吗",
  "orderNo": "SF10001"
}

### 旧无店铺入口退役：400，提示从店铺页面进入客服
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "你好"
}

